The code has four layers of parameters:
Layer 1 — Input
What data do we have?
Transcript, Call ID, Agent ID, account information.
Layer 2 — Qualification
Should this call enter this process?
eligibility, Level 2, Queue, account type.
Layer 3 — AI Understanding
